zorecto-welcome-title = Welcome
zorecto-welcome-subtitle = Try one of these to get started:
zorecto-suggest-cat1-title = Active Paper Insights
zorecto-suggest-cat1-1 = Give me a concise, 5-sentence summary of this paper, focusing on the main question, method, and key findings.
zorecto-suggest-cat1-2 = Explain the core idea of this paper in simple terms, as if I were a first-year grad student in this field.
zorecto-suggest-cat1-3 = List the main contributions of this paper and briefly explain why each one matters for the field.
zorecto-suggest-cat1-4 = Identify 3 strengths and 3 weaknesses of this paper’s methodology and experimental design.
zorecto-suggest-cat1-5 = What are the key assumptions in this paper? For each assumption, explain how it could fail in real-world scenarios.

zorecto-suggest-cat2-title = Test LLM
zorecto-suggest-cat2-1 = Act as a critical peer reviewer: write a short review of this paper with 2–3 major concerns and 2 minor comments.
zorecto-suggest-cat2-2 = Create a 5-question quiz (mixed multiple-choice and open-ended) to test whether someone truly understands this paper.
zorecto-suggest-cat2-3 = Pretend the main conclusion of this paper is wrong. Propose possible empirical evidence or arguments that could falsify it.
zorecto-suggest-cat2-4 = Compare the abstract, introduction, and conclusion of this paper and point out any inconsistencies or overselling.
zorecto-suggest-cat2-5 = Evaluate how logically coherent the argumentation in this paper is. Point out any logical gaps, weak links, or missing steps.

zorecto-suggest-cat3-title = Note-taking & Writing with This Paper
zorecto-suggest-cat3-1 = Extract the key concepts and definitions from this paper and present them as a bullet-point list for my notes.
zorecto-suggest-cat3-2 = Turn this paper into a structured outline with headings and subheadings that I can use as a reading note.
zorecto-suggest-cat3-3 = Generate 10 flashcards (Q&A style) based on this paper to help me remember the main ideas and technical details.
zorecto-suggest-cat3-4 = Rewrite the core argument of this paper in my own words to avoid plagiarism, while keeping the technical accuracy.
zorecto-suggest-cat3-5 = Given this paper, draft a short paragraph that I could use in a literature review to describe its role in the field.
